#restart.lua
@1 gave up the ghost.=@1 tiro la toalla.
POP!=
Restart in: @1 seconds.=Reanudar en @1 segundos.
You've come to your senses and decided to keep trying=Le pones buena cara al mal tiempo.
You can't use this command more than once per 5 minutes.=No puedes usar este comando más de una vez cada 5 minutos.
Restarting does not leave bones!=¡Reiniciar no deja huesos!
Your inventory will be deleted.=Su inventario será eliminado.
Are you sure?=Está seguro?
Give up on your current character without leaving a trace. Everything you hold will be lost. Have a new Exile appear in this world in their stead and try your hand at survival again.=
This command is an alias for /restart. See there for further information.=


